  "You can craft items at a campfire. Craft POKéBALLS using Apricorns.": "在篝火旁可以制作道具，用球果可以制作精灵球。",
  "If you white out during battle, you will return to the last place you used a sleeping bag. ": "对战中失去战斗能力后，会回到上次使用睡袋的地方。 ",
  "Ghosts may appear in the woods at night. A campfire will ward them off. ": "夜晚的树林中可能出现幽灵，篝火可以驱赶它们。 ",
  "Grass types know CUT. Use CUT on trees and tall grass to get building materials. ": "草属性宝可梦会居合斩。对树木和高草使用，可以获得建造材料。 ",
  "Fighting-types know BUILD. Use CUT buildings to remove them.": "格斗属性宝可梦会建造。对建筑使用居合斩，可以拆除建筑。",
  "POKéMON will lay EGGS when located near a compatible mate. ": "将相容的宝可梦放在附近，它们就会生蛋。 ",
  "Build fences to prevent your POKéMON from wandering off when you let them out of their POKéBALL. ": "围上栅栏，可以防止放出精灵球的宝可梦走远。 ",
  "Your POKéMON will be happier if fenced in and located near a shelter. ": "给宝可梦围上栅栏，并在附近建造庇护所，会让它们更快乐。 ",
  "POKéMON are happier when located in their natural habitat. If they are happy enough, they may give you items! ": "宝可梦在自然栖息地中更快乐。足够快乐时，它们可能会给你道具！ ",
  "Be wary of taking EGGS near wild POKéMON. Angry parents may attack! ": "拿取野生宝可梦附近的蛋要小心，愤怒的父母可能会攻击你！ ",
  "You can build a door between two house tiles to build a back or side door to your house. ": "在两块房屋建材之间建造门，可以做出后门或侧门。 ",
  "Sleeping indoors will restore hp twice as fast as sleeping outdoors. ": "在室内睡觉时，HP恢复速度是室外的两倍。 ",
  "Using your sleeping bag will slowly restore your party' hp. ": "使用睡袋会缓慢恢复同行宝可梦的HP。 ",
  "Use the escape rope to return to the nearest location on the shore. ": "使用离洞绳可以回到最近的岸边。 ",
  "You can plant Miracle Seeds and Apricorns to grow grass and trees. ": "种下奇迹种子和球果，可以长出草和树木。 ",
  "Eggs must be carried to hatch. RIDE does count while FLY does not.": "必须随身携带蛋才能孵化。骑乘时也计步，飞翔时不计步。",
  "Rocks types know SMASH. Use it on boulders to collect rocks. Rocks respawn daily.": "岩石属性宝可梦会碎岩。对巨石使用可以收集石头。巨石每天会重新出现。",
